<title>USA: Mattel, Tyco complete merger.</title>
<headline>Mattel, Tyco complete merger.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mattel Inc said a certificate of merger was filed in the State of Delaware, completing its merger with Tyco Toys Inc.</p>
